    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--c-ink-soft)">Last updated: July 2026</p>
      <p>
        This website is provided by SunHestia for informational purposes. Content
        describes our residential solar and battery storage products in general
        terms and does not constitute a binding offer.
      </p>
      <h2>Use of the site</h2>
      <p>
        You may use this site for personal, non-commercial purposes. Product
        specifications, availability and pricing are indicative and may change.
      </p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to keep information accurate and up to date, the site is
        provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.
      </p>
      <p>This is a summary; a complete version will be provided before production deployment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
